  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping and analysis of the policy framework for local governance in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A 6-month research study to map and analyse the existing policy processes and frameworks for local governance in Sri Lanka;  in order to strengthen the programmatic and advocacy intervention strategies of the Active Citizenship for Development Network (ACDN), with the goal of promoting greater citizens&apos; participation, and greater accountability, in governance in Sri Lanka.</narrative>
  </description>
